# Ideas Repository — Comprehensive .gitignore

# =====================================================
# NEVER UPLOAD TO GIT — Large Binary & Data Files
# =====================================================

# =====================================================
# TRAINING DATA — EXCLUDE CSV AND JSON FILES
# =====================================================

# Training data CSV files (can be gigabytes)
*.csv
data/*.csv
data/local/*.csv

# Training data JSON files (can be gigabytes)
*.json
data/*.json
data/local/*.json
!data/config.json
!data/sample.json

# Simulation results are not training data. These are small, deterministic
# artefacts that the papers cite by name - the blanket *.json rule above is
# why leviathan_sim_results.json was missing while a paper linked to it.
!*/**/outputs/*_results.json

# Excel spreadsheets
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.xlsm

# =====================================================
# Python Cache & Bytecode
# =====================================================

# Python cache
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.pyo
*.pyc
*.pyd

# =====================================================
# Python Environment
# =====================================================

# Python virtual environment (install with pip, not commit)
.venv/
venv/
ENV/
env/

# =====================================================
# Log Files
# =====================================================

# Log files
*.log
logs/
*.log.txt
*.txt.log
*.log.gz
*.log.bz2

# =====================================================
# Large Dataset & Model Files (Source-Only)
# =====================================================

# Neural network weights
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.h5
*.hdf5
*.npz
*.npy
models/
weights/
checkpoints/
snapshots/
training/
experiment/
experiments/

# Large binary data files
*.bin
*.dat
*.data

# =====================================================
# Build Artifacts
# =====================================================

build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
*.egg
MANIFEST
*.so
*.pyd

# =====================================================
# Temporary Files
# =====================================================

.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.hypothesis/
.coverage
htmlcov/
*.tmp
*.bak
*.backup
*.cache
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# =====================================================
# Environment & Configuration (Local Only)
# =====================================================

.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
*.pem
*.key
*.secret
*.sh
*.bash_history

# =====================================================
# Large Media & Archives (Re-Generate Instead)
# =====================================================

*.zip
*.rar
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.7z
*.iso

# =====================================================
# Documentation Build Artifacts (Optional)
# =====================================================

docs/site/
*.html
*.md.html
*_test.html
*_demo.html
*.pickle
*.joblib
*.pkl

# =====================================================
# Cypha-Specific Exclusions
# =====================================================

# Cypha-specific large files
bessel_ratios.npz
*.bin

# Config files (keep only examples)
config/*.jsonl
config/*.yaml
config/*.yml

# =====================================================
# Notes for This .gitignore
# =====================================================

# This .gitignore is designed to:
# - Prevent uploading gigabytes of data (CSV, JSON, models)
# - Keep only source code and documentation
# - Exclude build artifacts and temporary files
# - Exclude environment configurations

# IMPORTANT:
# - Research papers (.md, .pdf) ARE tracked
# - Markdown files ARE tracked
# - Code files ARE tracked
# - Training data CSV/JSON files are NOT tracked
# - Only binary, cache, and generated files are ignored